egrity and reproducibility\\n    27\\u2192\\n    28\\u2192- Exact SHA-256 hashes of the source and manifest files (`index.js`, `package.json`, `README.md`) are recorded in `checksums.txt` (standard `sha256sum` format).\\n    29\\u2192- Verify the inputs have not changed:\\n    30\\u2192\\n    31\\u2192  ```bash\\n    32\\u2192  sha256sum -c checksums.txt\\n    33\\u2192  ```\\n    34\\u2192\\n    35\\u2192- Regenerate `checksums.txt` after an intentional change:\\n    36\\u2192\\n    37\\u2192  ```bash\\n    38\\u2192  npm run hash\\n    39\\u2192  ```\\n    40\\u2192\\n    41\\u2192- Dependencies: none. Any dependency added in the future must be declared in `package.json` with an exact pinned version (no `^` or `~` ranges) so dependency inputs stay reproducible.\\n    42\\u2192\\n    43\\u2192## License\\n    44\\u2192\\n    45\\u2192MIT\\n    46\\u2192\"", "gen_ai.tool.call.id": "call_60330de0dbed4d4190858904"}, "events": [], "links": [], "resource": {"attributes": {"telemetry.sdk.language": "python", "telemetry.sdk.name": "opentelemetry", "telemetry.sdk.version": "1.44.0", "service.instance.id": "587b6737-87c5-4b7d-accd-1123fa620e1c", "service.name": "abb-evaluation"}, "schema_url": ""}, "live": false, "trace_id": "aa8123a6850c5c007b67bdbefc6d9c0f", "span_id": "dd343a98855f8ba8", "parent_span_id": "d1bd7797ec695e1d", "start_time_unix_nano": "1790310794241213898", "end_time_unix_nano": "1790310794268190861", "dropped_attributes": 0, "dropped_events": 0, "dropped_links": 0}}
